2. PROJECT PURPOSE
============================================================

The purpose of BI 5050 is not mastery of individual software tools.

The project develops the ability to combine programming and
spreadsheet modeling to produce professional analytical products
that inform business decisions.

The desired capability is to:

- select appropriate tools for the task
- exchange data between tools when necessary
- conduct appropriate analysis
- create professional analytical products
- create management-ready spreadsheets
- support discussion and decision-making

The model drives technology selection.

Technology must not drive the model.

============================================================
